LITERARY CONTENT & COPYRIGHT CLARIFICATION:
The MIT License above applies exclusively to the software code, tooling, algorithms,
and application architecture of this repository.

The original literary work "Mankutimmana Kagga" was composed by Dr. D. V. Gundappa (1887–1975).
Under Section 22 of the Indian Copyright Act, 1957, literary copyright remains protected
for 60 years following the calendar year of the author's death (until January 1, 2036).
The verses and spiritual commentaries presented in this application are preserved and shared
strictly for non-commercial educational, cultural study, and archival appreciation.
No claim of ownership or official affiliation with DVG's estate or authorized publishers is made.
